{"title": "Interplanar Slayer", "pageid": 28110, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Interplanar_Slayer", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Interplanar Slayer</b> is a passive feature that increases damage against otherworldly creatures.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This weapon grants a +1d4 bonus to damage and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> against <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">githyanki</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Aberration\" title=\"Aberration\">aberrations</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fiend\" title=\"Fiend\">fiends</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental\" title=\"Elemental\">elementals</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Voss%27_Silver_Sword\" title=\"Voss' Silver Sword\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Voss%27_Silver_Sword_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Voss%27_Silver_Sword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Voss%27_Silver_Sword_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Voss%27_Silver_Sword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Voss%27_Silver_Sword_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Voss%27_Silver_Sword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Voss%27_Silver_Sword_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Voss%27_Silver_Sword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Voss%27_Silver_Sword_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Voss%27_Silver_Sword\" title=\"Voss' Silver Sword\">Voss' Silver Sword</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Interplanar Slayer does not add the 1d4 bonus to attack rolls, though the damage bonus does apply to attacks made only with this weapon.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202951\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 982/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8345/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2416/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 754699/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.535      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00% 